// BT-4298: a stateless, open subclass of GuardedDiffClassRoot. Class-side
// sends to it reach the parent's class methods by inheritance, the parent's
// class-side extensions, and its own override of `describe`.

GuardedDiffClassRoot subclass: GuardedDiffClassLeaf

  class leafOnly -> Symbol => #leaf

  class describe -> String => "leaf"
